About this repository

This repository contains my practical JavaScript learning exercises as I develop my web development skills.

 Topics Covered

- JSON and JavaScript objects
- JSON.parse() and JSON.stringify()
- Fetch API
- Async/Await
- Working with API responses
- forEach()
- map()
- filter()

 Practical Project

Users API Practice

A simple webpage that fetches user information from JSONPlaceholder and displays names and email addresses.

Technologies Used

- HTML
- JavaScript
- JSON
- Fetch API

